        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG405-610-630, 24\" Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull is great for both residential and commercial applications. This stainless steel pull has a very durable satin finish. Measuring to 24 inches, this pull has a 14 inch center to center. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-D9002-specifications.gif?v=1704354534\" width=\"426\" height=\"215\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG405-610 Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/14-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-355-630\"><b>14\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/36-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-914-630\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/48-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-1220-630\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for AHI SIG405-610-630 Contemporary Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Height: 24\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14\" (355)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\" (76 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (27 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG405-610-specifications.pdf?v=1691093352\"><b>AHI SIG405-610 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
