                "title": "24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull, AHI SIG405-610-630",
                "description": "This 24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull is great for both residential and commercial applications. This stainless steel pull has a very durable satin finish. Measuring to 24 inches, this pull has a 14 inch center to center. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n",
